  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">PIMS &#x2013; 9513 CBIT Sao Tome Enhancing institutional and technical capacities for an effective implementation of the Enhanced Transparency Framework in Sao Tome and Principe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">S&#xe3;o Tom&#xe9; and Pr&#xed;ncipe, with support from the UNDP Climate Promise, is working to establish the legal and institutional foundations required to report national climate action under the UNFCCC and the Paris Agreement. To meet its reporting obligations under the Enhanced Transparency Framework (ETF), the country needs strong stakeholder engagement and strengthened national capacities.The project&#x2019;s main objective is to reinforce the institutional framework&#x2014;people, systems, and processes&#x2014;needed for a</narrative>
